      "level": "Beginner",
      "icon": "users",
      "title": "~하고",
      "description": "How to connect nouns.",
      "explanation": ["Use <b><hl>~하고</hl></b> to mean \"and\" for nouns."],
      "takeaway": "Used only for listing nouns.",
      "examples": [
        {
          "kr": "엄마하고 아빠가 와요.",
          "translated": "Mom and dad come."
