      "level": "Beginner",
      "icon": "clock",
      "title": "~았어요 / ~었어요",
      "description": "How to talk about the past.",
      "explanation": [
        "Use <b><hl>~았어요 / ~었어요</hl></b> for past tense.",
        "<br><br>Use <b>~았어요</b> with ㅏ/ㅗ, otherwise use <b>~었어요</b>."
